==Trivia==
This card's illustration forms a {{TCGP|narrative illustration}} with {{TCG ID|Mega Shine|Empoleon|20}} and {{TCG ID|Mega Shine|Trubbish|41}} from the same set. All of the standard illustrations in this group were first featured in the {{TCG|Legendary Treasures}} expansion, and also form the {{TCGP|Mega Shine}} expansion's "Toward a More Beautiful World" [[Mega Shine (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]].

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Legendary Treasures|Phione|36}} from the {{TCG|Legendary Treasures}} expansion.
*'''Aqua Turbo''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|BREAKpoint|Palkia-EX|31}} from the {{TCG|BREAKpoint}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Alpha Sapphire}}.

